# Home (source/screens/home.c), the stand-in list until B12's carousel: the
# items the card holds (Recent from its v0.3 list, GBA's games) in the
# carousel's order with what each holds, the torii glyph and the hint bar.
# DOWN moves to the next item, whose accent the pill takes (the pill's
# slide hashed every frame); UP at the top wraps to Info.
-w "nav: home ready"
-s @1:screen.png
-k @8:DOWN -k @12:-
-H @8:@20
-s @24:down.png
-k @30:UP -k @34:- -k @42:UP -k @46:-
-s @70:wrapped.png
